OL,3,GNEWSACouncil issues more than 50
OL,4,Aclimate action grants
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 community projects will
OL,7,Freceive climate action grants after a
OL,8,Fsummer of heatwaves.
OL,10,FOxfordshire County Council awarded
OL,11,Ffunding to help kickstart 54 projects
OL,12,Ftackling the impacts of extreme
OL,13,Fweather.
OL,15,FThe grants range from #85 to #3,000 and
OL,16,Fwill be used by 31 Oxfordshire
OL,17,Forganisations exploring climate action
OL,18,Fin the face of high temperatures,
OL,19,Ffloods, droughts and storms.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
