OL,5,
OL,6,FThe funds are part of an expanded
OL,7,Fcommunity resilience grants programme,
OL,8,Fadministered by Community Action Groups
OL,9,FOxfordshire (CAG) and funded by #44,724
OL,10,Ffrom Oxfordshire County Council.
